---
layout: layouts/piece.njk
title: "The Café — Closed days door sign, letter (black & white)"
canvasW: "11in"
canvasH: "8.5in"
pageSize: "11in 8.5in"
pageCss: "/assets/css/studio/sign.css"
bw: true

# The days closed, from specials.json (as typed on the kitchen board): the
# first one's reason is the big word, the last one's message the line at the
# bottom. `back` is the next day open.
closedDates: ["2026-11-26", "2026-11-27"]
back: "2026-11-30"

tags: studio
studioWeekly: true
studioTitle: "Closed Thursday & Friday — door sign (letter)"
studioCategory: "Signs"
studioSize: "11 × 8.5 in landscape · taped inside the door glass"
studioNote: "Letter-size closed sign for more than one day (Mitch 2026-11-23: Thanksgiving and the Friday after). Reads the closed days from specials.json, so set closedDates and back in the front matter. The one-day 11 × 17 sign is sign-closed-bw."
studioW: 1056
studioH: 816
studioOrder: 26
---
{#- A run of closed days at letter size. "Closed" is the biggest thing on
    it and there's no week strip: the holiday says enough (Mitch 2026-11-23). -#}
{%- set first = (specials.days | where("date", closedDates[0]))[0] or {} %}
{%- set last = (specials.days | where("date", closedDates | last))[0] or {} %}
{%- set why = first | closedText | replace("Closed for ", "") %}
{%- set closedDate = closedDates[0] %}
{%- set o = site.opening %}
<div class="canvas sign sign--bw door door--closed door--letter">
    <h2 class="p-display dc-closed">Closed</h2>
    {%- if why and why != "Closed" %}
    <p class="p-display-italic dc-why">for {{ why }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
    <p class="dc-date">
        {%- for d in closedDates %}{{ " & " if not loop.first }}{{ d | dayDate("weekday") }}{% endfor %}
    </p>
    <p class="dc-dates">
        {{- closedDates[0] | dayDate("monthDay") }}{% for d in closedDates %}{% if not loop.first %} & {{ d.split("-")[2] | int }}{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
    </p>

    <div class="sign-spacer"></div>
    <p class="dc-back">Back {{ back | dayDate("long") }} at {{ o.opens.time | replace(":00", "") }}{{ o.opens.meridiem }}</p>
    {%- if last.message %}
    <p class="p-display-italic dc-thanks">{{ last.message }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
</div>
